### Tariff API

```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Tariff API
  version: 1.0.0

paths:
  /api/v1/tariffs:
    get:
      summary: Список тарифов
      parameters:
        - name: operator_id
          in: query
          schema: { type: string }
        - name: type
          in: query
          schema:
            type: string
            enum: [mobile, fixed, bundle]
